From e5c8768b1a2e7373ce36ca9f68cf531c440a9fdc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ObliviOS Build <build@oblivios.local>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 19:00:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] oblivios: hide the real user from the decoy session's
 UI and conceal multi-user existence

oblivios: hide real-user identity from the decoy session's UI surfaces

Squash of former patches:

- 0017 oblivios: add UserManager.getUsersForUiDisplay for decoy session UI filtering
- 0018 oblivios: route SystemUI user-switcher and power-menu through getUsersForUiDisplay
- 0019 oblivios: route SettingsLib storage measurement through getUsersForUiDisplay
- 0020 oblivios: mark decoy user setup-complete at registration time
- 0021 oblivios: clear calling identity for decoy setup-complete write
- 0022 oblivios: validate decoy user type, drop UnsupportedAppUsage
- 0023 oblivios: treat decoy user as main-user-equivalent for Wallet QS tile
- 0024 oblivios: fix getUsersForUiDisplay to key off current user, not caller
- 0025 oblivios: fix legacy power-menu fallback to use getUsersForUiDisplay
- 0026 oblivios: fix uninstall dialogs' single-user check to use getUsersForUiDisplay
- 0027 oblivios: route areThereMultipleUiSwitchableUsers through getUsersForUiDisplay

oblivios: make the decoy session's UI match a single-owner device

Squash of former patches:

- 0029 oblivios: add UserManager.isMainForUiDisplay primitive
- 0030 oblivios: suppress End session affordance for decoy session
- 0031 oblivios: hide user-switcher-enabled state for the decoy's own current-user view
- 0032 oblivios: route SystemUI user-switcher-enabled state through UserManager
- 0033 oblivios: refresh lockscreen multi-user avatar visibility on enabled-state change
- 0034 oblivios: use owner's default-avatar color for a decoy's own SystemUI icon
- 0035 oblivios: use owner's default-avatar color in SettingsLib.Utils#getUserIcon

oblivios: use the actual target user for CE-storage checks in backup and storage

Squash of former patches:

- 0028 oblivios: fix UserBackupManagerService using wrong Context for CE-storage check
- 0036 oblivios: check the actual target user, not user 0, for volume-report gating
- 0037 oblivios: initialize ExternalStorageService component on any user's unlock
- 0038 oblivios: resolve ExternalStorageService as the actually-unlocking user

oblivios: conceal multi-user existence on pre-unlock surfaces

Squash of former patches:

- 0039 test: add coverage for pre-unlock decoy concealment in isUserSwitcherEnabled
- 0040 test: force user switcher setting on for pre-unlock concealment tests
- 0041 oblivios: conceal multi-user existence on pre-unlock surfaces
- 0042 oblivios: rename decoy-identifying log tags and messages to neutral text
